## ZES Toolkit (Tier 1 — OpenHuman-inspired)

### zjuice — TokenJuice Output Compressor
Compresses verbose tool outputs via BitRouter LLM summarization (up to 98% reduction)
with fallback to intelligent head+tail truncation.
```
long-command 2>&1 | zjuice
```

### zcontext — SuperContext Pre-Read
Sweeps the Memory Hub before every session to eliminate cold starts.
Runs automatically on session start (configured in settings.json hooks).
```
zcontext          # full briefing
zcontext --brief  # compact version
```

### zautofetch — Auto-Fetch Memory Pipeline
Background daemon (runsv-managed) that fetches GitHub notifications + file changes
into the Memory Hub every 20 minutes.
```
sv status zautofetch
tail -f ~/logs/zautofetch/zautofetch.log
```

## ZES Toolkit (Tier 2 — OpenHuman-inspired)

### zflow — Checkpointed Durable Workflows
SQLite-backed workflow runner with resume support. Survives restarts.
```
zflow init <name>              # create template
zflow run <name>               # execute, resumes if interrupted
zflow list                     # list all workflows
zflow status [name]            # show step-by-step status
zflow reset <name>             # restart from step 1
```

### zroute — Intelligent Model Router
Routes tasks to the optimal BitRouter model based on task type.
```
zroute "code review this PR"   # → anthropic/claude-fable-5
zroute "quick search"          # → deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash
zroute --test                  # run test suite
zroute --list                  # show routing table
```

### zloop — Subconscious Goal Loop
Background daemon (runsv-managed) that reads memory hub, tracks incomplete
workflows, and generates daily summaries every 30 minutes.
```
zloop                          # one-shot cycle
zloop --summary                # today's briefing
zloop --goals                  # goal status
sv status zloop                # daemon status
tail -f ~/logs/zloop/zloop.log
```

