## Rules

1. Write shared memories when you learn facts other agents need.
2. Run `zes-memory-bridge export` after adding knowledge.
3. Check `~/.zes/shared-memory.md` before asking questions another agent already answered.
4. Use `| zjuice` for large command outputs to save context.
5. Run `zcontext` at session start to load memory context.
6. Use `zroute <task>` to pick the optimal model for any job.
7. Run `zflow run` on workflow scripts in `~/.zes/workflows/`. Add new ones there.
